# Large regenerable inputs and intermediates - `pipeline/00_fetch_data.py`
# re-downloads the inputs and the pipeline rebuilds the rest.
data/*
# Inputs to step 5b that the pipeline CANNOT regenerate on a clean clone:
# llm_scores.json costs API calls to reproduce and is the evidence trail of
# what the model actually returned; verified_overrides.json is hand-authored
# from primary sources and is not reproducible at all. Without these, a fresh
# clone silently falls back to the in-session grades and loses the verified
# DKK1 correction - the exact silent-degradation failure this project has
# already hit twice.
!data/llm_scores.json
!data/llm_scores_insession.json
!data/verified_overrides.json
reference/*
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
